// MISTAKE-free control: `relaxed` demotes the overdraft to a warning, and the
// summary should still say so.
base USD
use std
relaxed

account assets/checking : bank
account expenses/rent
account equity/opening

entity landlord : org
  via expenses/rent

2025-12-31 equity/opening -> checking 800 USD
2026-01-01 checking -> landlord 1_800 USD
